Dialogue: 1,0:24:04.67,0:24:12.97,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}あの日　握り返した
Comment: 0,0:23:05.11,0:23:08.12,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 2,0:23:08.12,0:23:14.17,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}在另一側 今天仍有人
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.29,0:23:20.13,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}日漸頹敗 卻仍然站立
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.30,0:23:26.01,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}刺痛胸口的這份寂寞
Dialogue: 2,0:23:26.18,0:23:31.89,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}點或是線 斷斷續續
Dialogue: 2,0:23:31.89,0:23:34.94,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}面具碎裂
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.94,0:23:37.90,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}那無法迴避的一切
Dialogue: 2,0:23:37.90,0:23:40.94,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}不得不活下去
Dialogue: 2,0:23:40.94,0:23:45.61,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}明天已經在等待
